### Sağlık Kontrolü
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### ======== BÖLGE ========

### Bölge oturumu başlat (regionId — GET /api/regions'tan gelir)
### Aynı bölge için tekrar çağrılırsa açık oturumu döndürür (resume)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/region/start
Content-Type: application/json

{ "regionId": 1 }

### Bölge tamamlandı
POST http://localhost:3001/api/region/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "regionSessionId": 1 }

### Bölgeleri listele (hasActiveSession ile)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/regions
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Bir bölgenin üreticileri (o bölgeye atanmışlar + allRegions olanlar)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/regions/1/producers
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### ======== GİRİŞ ========

### Ürün girişi kaydet
POST http://localhost:3001/api/entry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "regionSessionId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "qualityId": 1,
  "caseCount": 10,
  "weight": 125.5,
  "marketId": 3
}

### ======== PAZARLAR ========

### Tüm pazarları listele (pendingCount dahil)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/markets

### Pazar'ın bekleyen girişlerini getir
GET http://localhost:3001/api/markets/3/entries

### ======== ÇIKIŞ ========

### İrsaliye oluştur
POST http://localhost:3001/api/exit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "marketId": 3, "entryIds": [1, 2] }

### ======== ADMIN AUTH ========

### Giriş yap — token'ı kopyala
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "admin123" }

### ======== ADMIN CRUD (token gerekli) ========

### Bölgeleri listele
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/regions
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Bölge ekle
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/regions
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Yeni Bölge" }

### Bölge güncelle
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/admin/regions/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Güzelyurt (Güncellendi)" }

### Bölge sil
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/admin/regions/9
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Ürünleri listele
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Pazarları listele (admin)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/markets
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Pazar ekle
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/markets
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "no": 21, "name": "Pazar 21" }

### ======== RAPORLAR ========

### Günlük özet
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/reports/daily?date=2026-05-02
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Pazar bazlı rapor
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/reports/by-market?date=2026-05-02
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Ürün bazlı rapor
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/reports/by-product?date=2026-05-02
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Son 7 günün en çok gelenleri
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/reports/top-products?days=7&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
